ra:2541518.lineup_text:
@bonaimewashere
Bon Aime is an Amsterdam-based DJ and producer whose sound draws on a wide range of influences, from delta blues to disco, landing somewhere soulful and upbeat but distinctly his own. His productions feature colourful sampling, gritty drums, and session performances from a crew of Amsterdam-based musicians.
Bon Aime is also co-founder of @JazzClub, the Amsterdam-based event concept that brings musicians into a club setting, blending DJ sets with real-time improvisation for a sound that's part house, part jazz.

